{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42123","headline":"游蒋山题辛夷花寄陈奉礼 · 徐铉","name":"游蒋山题辛夷花寄陈奉礼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今岁游山已恨迟，山中仍喜见辛夷。\n簪缨且免全爲累，桃李犹堪别作期。\n晴後日高偏照灼，晚来风急渐离披。\n山郎不作同行伴，折得何由寄所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}